# Untracked project-layer skills (migrated from .pi-sandbox/skills per room
# 000791c5 ruling: stay in the CAFF project, load via .agents/skills
# discovery, but never enter git). They live under a single _private root so
# one rule covers the whole private layer; pi discovers them recursively and
# does not read the repo-root .gitignore for that scan. The contract-layer
# skills stay directly under .agents/skills/ and remain git-tracked.
# See docs/engineering/skills/skill-migration-runbook.md.
/.agents/skills/_private/
